## 2. API Contract Principle

All runtime APIs must exchange information through approved Runtime APIs and Execution JSON Contracts.

The required relationship is:

```text
Runtime API
    ↓
Execution JSON Contract
    ↓
Trace Context
    ↓
Evidence
    ↓
Validation
    ↓
Replay
```

An API must not introduce an independent or incompatible contract without corresponding runtime and governance updates.

---

