## 4. Trace Propagation Requirement

Every constitutional runtime API operation that participates in an execution trace should preserve the originating `trace_id`.

Expected flow:

```text
Input
  ↓
API
  ↓
Runtime Stage
  ↓
Evidence
  ↓
Validation
  ↓
Replay
```

Expected invariant:

```text
same execution
        =
same trace_id
```

A missing, changed, malformed, or independently regenerated trace identifier must be treated as a trace-integrity observation.

