## 6. Deterministic API Requirement

NICAI is designed as a deterministic intelligence system.

For identical valid inputs and identical runtime state:

```text
Same Input
    ↓
Same Contract
    ↓
Same Runtime Rules
    ↓
Same Output
```

The API layer must not introduce uncontrolled randomness into constitutional runtime execution.

Where deterministic equivalence has not been independently demonstrated, this document records the requirement rather than claiming proof.

