## 12. API Ownership Boundary

API ownership must remain explicit.

```text
NICAI
  ↓
Intelligence Generation
  ↓
Bounded API Contract
  ↓
External Runtime / Ecosystem
```

NICAI must not claim ownership of an external registry, validation system, replay service, or knowledge-management service unless that ownership is explicitly established.

The architectural governance mapping assigns:

| Component                 | Responsibility                |
| ------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| NICAI                     | Intelligence Generation       |
| SVACS                     | Validation & Verification     |
| Runtime Engineering Team  | Runtime Execution             |
| Operations Command Center | Operational Decision Approval |
| Marine MasterDB           | Master Data Management        |

Every runtime operation should have a clearly defined owner.

